{ from_pretrained

 `from_pretrained` creates a Llama model from the given pretrained model name or path.
  
  This method requires → development/languages/Python/libraries/huggingface_hub`.

code { 
from llama_cpp import Llama

llm = Llama.from_pretrained(
   repo_id   ='bartowski/Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct-GGUF',
   local_dir ='.',
   filename  ='Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct-Q4_K_L.gguf',
   verbose   = False,
   n_ctx     = 4096
)

print(type(llm)) # llama_cpp.llama.Llama
